1. **ORCHESTRATOR** â€” Harmonizes Paris Agreement, GBF, SDGs into unified national "Regenerative Transition Plans" (RTPs)
2. **FINANCIER** â€” Operates a **Global Regenerative Finance Facility (GRFF)** mobilizing $2-4T/year via blended finance, SDR reallocation, fossil fuel subsidy redirection, and carbon pricing
3. **ACCELERATOR** â€” Deploys **Mission Control Hubs** for 10 breakthrough transitions (energy, food, cities, nature, industry, transport, health, education, finance, governance)

